{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09018","headline":"寄子西 · 韦应物","name":"寄子西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏景已难度，怀贤思方续。\n乔树落疎阴，微风散烦燠。\n伤离枉芳札，忻遂见心曲。\n蓝上舍已成，田家雨新足。\n托邻素多欲，残帙犹见束。\n日夕上高斋，但望东原绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}